  "description": "Beta announcer, Eun Gi-Hyeon, is a well-known personality thanks to his famous brother’s widespread influence as a big-shot actor. However, Gi-Hyeon's strings of fate began to tangle once his secondary sex is diagnosed as an...Omega?! \n\nAfter an accidental encounter, Kim Min-Jun finds out that he and Gi-Hyeon are destined to be each other’s ‘fated pair’. Will Min-Jun let himself be swayed by the current of destiny?\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
